parakeet-redux is a really interesting beast. You can extract the VAD head and then, you discover that has better recall than Silero. Despite the footprint compared to it, offline might have other uses.



@vikhyatk cooked hard here, congrats for the release, and thanks for working in the open!



By the way, all Parakeet-redux models are now in parakeet.cpp (links below). And you can use parakeet now as standalone VAD with both.

